    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d42">

                <pb facs="0122" n="30" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg30"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to Marshal Stalin</hi><anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d42-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">operational priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-10-14">14 October 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Personal and secret from President Roosevelt to Marshal Stalin.</p>
                <p>The Secretary of State and his Staff are well on their way to Moscow but it seems
                    doubtful at this time that they will be able to get there before the
                    seventeenth. I will let you know of their progress.</p>
                <pb facs="0123" n="31" xml:id="pg31"/>
                <p>I am much disturbed in regard to the location of the other meeting but I will
                    send you this problem in another message.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d42-f2"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d42-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d42-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the United States Naval Attach, Moscow, via Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d42-f2" n="2" xml:id="d42-f2-content">
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
